{"ID":"20240314092237-uyc63bh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092237-uyc63bh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092237-uyc63bh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160827-3ze6sar\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160827-pbed1sw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160827-pbed1sw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:16,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:16\u0026#125;","title":"【消肿溃坚汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422160827-3ze6sar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-3ze6sar","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"消肿溃坚汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160827-dsgeusr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-dsgeusr","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"昆布海藻黄柏知母栝蒌根桔梗三棱莪术连翘黄芩黄连葛根柴胡当归龙胆草甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160827-b7rkxxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-b7rkxxa","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们回到 91 页，在继续下一章节之前，有个处方啊，我们把它补进去。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160827-1ue6hql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-1ue6hql","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"91 页讲到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"马刀侠瘿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有没有，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甲状腺肿瘤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦，那淋巴结肿瘤，最常使用的呢，我们叫做消肿溃坚汤啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160827-xl58xfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-xl58xfn","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个消肿溃坚汤呢，很早以前我们就知道，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"昆布用海藻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，现在西洋人来说就是缺碘嘛，那中医以前就用昆布跟海藻，所以是，中西是吻合的哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160827-yipf84c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-yipf84c","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄柏、知母还有呢，栝蒌根、桔梗、三棱、莪术、连翘、黄芩、黄连啊、葛根、柴胡、当归、龙胆草啊，最后甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个是我们过去一直在用来治疗甲状腺肿瘤的时候，它的全名叫做消肿溃坚汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"方义很简单，用柴胡进入三焦系统"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们的腺体哦，甲状腺、腋下腺、汗腺，统统是啊......腺，我们用柴胡，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般来说这种都会燥热，病人会烦躁、燥热，三黄泻心汤啊，黄柏、黄芩、黄连"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"海藻、昆布本来就是咸味能软坚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。西洋人说碘，中医认为说这两个是咸味，哦，咸呢能软坚，坚硬的东西，那老师，牡蛎可不可以，当然可以呀。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160827-dllnwtj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-dllnwtj","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去如果这个处方吃下去没有效，甲状腺还肿在里面的时候，我当场就设计处方啊，我们不用去背，我们设计一个处方一样消得很快哦。那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"知母除烦躁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为甲状腺的人呢，亢进的人都会啊心动悸哦，人会慌，手会抖，那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桔梗呢是去痰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，里面的燥痰，焦痰，哦，诸如此类的，那这是清热解毒啊（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄柏黄芩黄连"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），那这是活血化瘀，三棱、莪术都是活血化瘀的药。这是使用的比较普遍的一个处方，诸位看《医方集解》里面也可以看到。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160827-q0gompd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-q0gompd","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果说，你遇到这种甲状腺大脖子的人啊，那你，这个消肿溃坚汤吃了一段时间后如果没有效，你问他那个症状。那你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可以主力呢用牡蛎，用龙骨牡蛎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，动悸得很厉害的时候...老师我这个甲状腺哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心悸，晚上慌心慌得很厉害，手会抖，桂枝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我平常开处方桂枝一开就是 5 钱哦，你不要说老师，这桂枝不能吃，吃下去很不得了，我都开 5 钱 3 钱 5 钱常常在开的哦，桂枝跟"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦，心动悸嘛，心动悸，那加上牡蛎，病人呢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"盗汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很严重，晚上睡觉的时候盗汗心悸，就"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"龙骨牡蛎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦，牡蛎攻坚用的，牡蛎呢1 两，龙骨用 5 钱，收敛哦盗汗的情形，那桂枝龙骨牡蛎汤出来了，是不是经方里面的？《伤寒论》就这个处方，然后呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"进入淋巴系统，防己"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，防己是入三焦系统，就是我用的很多呢，我们随便找一个方子，在这里本草经里面找一个，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓦楞子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个瓦楞子呢长相啊，贝壳个这样子，长的就这个样子啊，你如果跑到南门市场去买，叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"血蚶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊。这个贝壳呢打开，你看到里面是血，看看是血，好像很多血在里面啊，这个血蚶的壳就叫做瓦楞子，因为它长相就像个乳房，然后呢，它里面是血，这个瓦楞子呢也是味咸，咸味能够软坚，所以我在治疗那个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳房硬块、甲状腺的硬块、淋巴癌的时候，瓦楞子用得非常多"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160827-ojj34ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-ojj34ui","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个在这章结束之前呢，我们补出这样一个处方哦。甲状腺的问题呢绝对可以治好，千万不要去开刀哦，一定可以治好哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160827-pbed1sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160827-pbed1sw","updated":"20240422160827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们休息一下哦，待会我们再继续。"}]}]}